 "title": "Room 1.2 · Blink Dog (CR 1/4) · Moderate, 50 XP · cleared on 2 HP",
 "headline": "One Blink Dog nearly ended the Delve in its second room. It teleported straight onto Morten, shrugged off Sleep, and a natural 20 bite left him on 2 HP before a potion and Thunderwave finished it.",
 "prose": [],
 "bullets": [
  {
   "label": "The room",
   "text": "8×10 sq (12×15 m) with a 3 m ledge along the east wall. The owl spotted the dog, and the dog spotted the owl."
  },
  {
   "label": "What went wrong",
   "text": "the doorway trick doesn't work on a dog that teleports. It blinked 8 sq straight to Morten's side and bit before he could act. Shield turned the first bite (16 into a miss at AC 20). Sleep then held on a natural 20, but the dog made its save (14 vs DC 13), so his first action did nothing."
  },
  {
   "label": "The dice",
   "text": "Magic Missile hit for 12 force dmg, but the second cast fizzled (10 vs DC 11), so it's lost until the Long Rest. Then the dog rolled a natural 20 for 9 dmg, which took Morten from 11 to **2 HP**."
  },
  {
   "label": "How it ended",
   "text": "the Potion of Healing as a bonus action (+6, to 8 HP), then Thunderwave in the same turn. The dog failed its CON save on a 3, and 10 thunder dmg dropped it from exactly 10 HP to 0."
  },
  {
   "label": "Result",
   "text": "8/20 HP, potion gone, Magic Missile lost. XP 975 → 1,025. +5 GP."
  }
 ],
